OL,3,GNEWSACouncil grants RNLI honour after
OL,4,Avolunteer abuse
OL,5,
OL,6,FA council will grant the Royal National
OL,7,FLifeboat Institution (RNLI) its highest
OL,8,Fcivic honour following recent hostility
OL,9,Fdirected towards its volunteers.
OL,11,FPortsmouth city councillors agreed to
OL,12,Faward the charity the Freedom of the
OL,13,FCity at a full council meeting on
OL,14,FTuesday.
OL,16,FIn mid-October, council members
OL,17,Fapproved a notice of motion supporting
OL,18,Fthe award of the civic honour to the
OL,19,FEastney lifeboat station.
OL,23,APub: 11-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
