OL,3,GNEWSACouncil grants RNLI honour after
OL,4,Avolunteer abuse
OL,5,
OL,6,FIt came after the charity's volunteers
OL,7,Fwere targeted by anti-migrant
OL,8,Fprotesters for their role in rescuing
OL,9,Fsmall boat migrants in the English
OL,10,FChannel.
